This distribution repackages the upstream CompreFace 1.2.0 source code into independently
built and deployed container images (namespace "mega") with Kubernetes manifests and
configuration changes for an on-premise, air-gapped environment. The application source
code under java/, ui/ and embedding-calculator/ is used unmodified; all original copyright
and license headers are retained.

Third-party components bundled in the container images (e.g. OpenJDK/Eclipse Temurin,
nginx, PostgreSQL, TensorFlow, MXNet, InsightFace, FaceNet models) are distributed under
their own licenses. Pre-trained ML models are downloaded at build time from the locations
defined by upstream CompreFace and remain subject to their respective licenses.
